   "C23": [
    "Opened from Manage Animals in Add or Edit mode only. There is no View mode (decision 20, Neil 2026-10-08 14:31 BST). Animal.Attributes is stored as a JSON array of strings (jsonb, NOT NULL, default []); the Tag Input control reads/writes that array as chips. DB schema (decision 21, Neil 2026-10-08 14:35 BST): Animal is stored in the new creatures schema as creatures.animals (not auth.animals); entity, column and API names are unchanged. Registration / grants / migration details follow Q24-Q27 in plan.md (suggested defaults accepted 15:44 BST). Persistence-only columns written by the Animals service with no control on this form: NormalizedName (derived from Name for uniqueness), IsDeleted (false on create), UpdatedUtc and UpdatedBy (signed-in user's id, set on every create/update), plus the platform Id and CreatedUtc. Add, Edit and Save require the animals_write permission (policy AnimalsWrite; decisions 22, 24); users without it cannot open this form in any mode (or Manage Animals at all). Edit is opened from Edit Animal in the Manage Animals row actions menu (decisions 23, 26). Opening a soft-deleted animal (by id or a stale link) returns not found.",
